  "label": "Colonel Sanders is mapped as the entity opening a KFC in Wakanda",
  "description": "The text 'when col sanders opens a kfc in wakanda' explicitly identifies Colonel Sanders as the central actor in the scenario. The visual material shows Colonel Sanders, the iconic KFC mascot, who is directly mapped onto this textual role. The meme's humor and satirical intent rely on this direct analogical mapping: the visual of Colonel Sanders is understood as representing the 'col sanders' in the text, who is performing the action of 'opening a kfc in wakanda'.",
